{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1212,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e898fe005a0ad0832cab9f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不想动～…\n就像第2周的蝉一样\n没什么精神…",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c77a6b30466f7e8beeac3f02e031b40cedf8d70427cc86d10cd9d5ccc3c331",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fce468790866372f9dd0f05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经不行了～…\n喂…今天歇了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9f38a574f7cd42b56be00b41056730b30b1e6db3a32d71d2656117f9838a43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:221c339171781c06c551ad79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点…快点给我命令！！\n这边已经等不及了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c408dfcee8edd83d9cee64a679c0aad52d3345b4e9762cc1702d31bf9665694c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149e999faaec0a7aa8a1a5c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小金船大・爆・发！！\n干劲MAX，得意忘形啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf36f944d81959e91ec376d43eb18153af1630b44673bea7629f79c8ea330ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3a919f4cbf5d03c6ea013e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点随便找个地方\n出发吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "217f48d7614b1ed2005645eb3cb37cad25865bfabea8d36f003fbd107880e49e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be8a9f0edd44e8fce2242405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐，我能跑过来吗！？\n因为我现在的精力\n多的没处花啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53559fe263d867c8d4f4bf3fa9f1eba0d8aa8056b79887ee8395a1d1a3a6c3e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4f256b80d72f06199f5d8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，要开始了吗？\n可以啊，来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79ecc45dfd3c21308fd10f8d37acf1a922185c38418b29b60a65142daef620f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896eb85dbc4102ac58065976",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要怎么做？\n如果有预定计划的话讲给我听听吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1432233c6c36f1d33ac13ef8fd7a9095a103fe80d6cc48b73597ca456ca1cfce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a4f9280ced12bdf18ad6ae4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…啊啊，是训练员吗…\n抱歉哈，现在我一直在考虑\n『赏金猎人曽我部』的事情…",
      "source_fingerprint": "97dc962846448776854ab1131f62f7655a3573ee7b12775ece9aa6589d821fa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac40c4de0254d26880c27496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊，哈啊…！！\n…不行啊，现在让我稍微坐会吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "865888f8053fce43d45fc0774d52ea6e45cd4e3931450dc8f787d46a8a11975d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c3af7b6233c969f54975f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不妙啊…意识融化了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8757d4e9fd29872e214f3d61fca0665f494cb81a1754cba9c4a6b7a29165abfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f957bb3c8924627432f723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇，呐—…\n结束以后喊我起来吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "10653f8540c6aa6dc6c4b3f7ef92324f56a871d0b081523b0908f0e1640e4d32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7672df1c3942dc529b1b718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂，又是比赛吗？\n我可是一点都不想跑的样子啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2258cadb77f6c55e35369d7a5a13fb1b2a23a65e208164c5ccb3864d03020eda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5547637197034a2b29704375",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈！？还没跑够吗！？\n这我得拿小金船保护法\n起诉你啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdad141af842a217edb63b6693337f5d63fa7796a7ba5c84afc6bf3f64ba825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bd46501b5e6f50ff62d35ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶——！！\n不管是鲨鱼海豚还是鲸鱼，\n统统放马过来！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3dd2198d6ba030978328c0025eeca4d5ea9d69cad450233795f63b15a53378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d280542520ce0ead71773841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备充分！！\n去发现金银财宝吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce9c641264e6d1f3767f54de9cff186ff40e74794eccdeb5cd1f9850ad8e6b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:302bf6132b317e8b62ad1863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是宴会吗！？是比赛吗！？\n两个都是吗！？\n行啊，接受挑——战！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3db157cad7ce1295e53bd96bfe60c639a3eebc0cabfe4785715b93a6b6b3db1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fa3db1e41184c3efb64fd76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉到那个\n很顺利啊！\n就是感觉到的那个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "251a3d517202e0fe4ce67a89a4dd0c454e9a50c61d969203692e9796ab8c1f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36d18651970a112662b25ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要说是乌龟还是兔子，\n那就是兔子的状态吧，唔嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c627cae464ac4ce7ebfe47873a845d6e36b0035c95fb4639686b289256cc23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23a2ad7e1fa0d1a95f21d2f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "杜鹃跑起来的话，\n就可以赢给你看哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb9a093bf63d57d81ca32217abe84c8048165346dfb4eab790e98575cc578b2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:970487e1d8a9b7eb9671a827",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！\n就等着比赛的时候了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0869f1516f33813059b43c2f28652f4be61f14694f6739c6b2f46b13042f4843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba5d136d3aa505b05f129f79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，适当的跑的话，\n应该会顺利的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "874d6b2f2f09fff26143c4a770d53dd2dd7d13af154d59b25e0f9c081eeb9a3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95923521b13f3f9c97e67a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最重要的是什么都不想。\n一边看着天上一边跑吧～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde5542c700bf7120a3f2f4dd2a78f82c096ac5d684ca62e9fea3f790c1ce5ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ebdd54f120971392b5bca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊—…天空真美啊—…",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10b279379cbfa7fc31363ed9120127da35d45878c10f9fb4109576f02f01e0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daedd1dc045a3024b81edca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉，现在从第9行星\n来了联络。\n可以稍等一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8494705ce59cf1bd8d3817e57e5c2ba784266eb8fb959b4117cb70c5e9c5a6c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bea4f9bcf6a6d02fba9de020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想吃鲭鱼三明治。\n能买吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73034f64b10c92287aad9d3490272674dcfc693a2ac14a9ee0f31741d637dd39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:365ec19c4e89f558657b012d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在开始跑是认真的吗…\n我光是站着就\n嫌麻烦了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f482468913c7032bf2f4efcdc4a6e11856fa4d05d8773598980bb52194291be2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:576950ae4365111e965bcb3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要是在比赛中停下来了的话，\n你就背着我\n代替我到终点吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bff75621808fe4e981c779b44b02edc4061bb49a03430d13f532913d1788d96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc08ef4f0d33ef4bd29673df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果转世的话\n会变成蜗牛的吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d98ff3f0ae88dd4893343027d8cd3079fc29bafb6ccbe79839153545fe34489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36eff87a70b4909819391abf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:127eef9c2b0cebae720df756",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b8624abed948d0e6a84b94335e1037decef0acf48c44155fdd86e0f5fcff33b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3c823e59dd142dd71fee3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "振作起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1dc951a8d412cc66abcd22a8cde91a902f5fa3cb119d3b330576d5656781eec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb58e4fea3e0caba5b276a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "余裕余裕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1473834a1425aa78a903609dd296ccc3d193431cad535c9f95570ad2ea85ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb75ce3f3f0a86f4057fc463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c244da16b3b1037f186cc9f525b63c75ade45762e3cc6bc4e551a53ddf9d7d04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe9e2729d540ca4d3b6add8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搞不懂啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "80fa1c5f67cd89c32afa371c63837438c620e99ab41ff4461ccef8694deb9c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:271f0f4da4e8c228cab0cf08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "663f67e6d36e16231932887bb1e3eb2db26e1fb205d758f58e5da16072deb3e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced3a0df076952ef2c625e48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全速前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d05af7e631631981098026515a9a87db4eac5aee0ae5f9690108b975d13ad93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:557918c437a4ffa3cb6b8880",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Thank you very much！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf02c49167c51931472c852bda719c30c5a8e623bd522d7887ee8778ab949053",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250cf1d9de220658fb77c90b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢啦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7d615aa5fb4064629ca37737b6132b598c670e96c5e5c6da2e25102d72bda6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eddab1e93bc6415dceed6a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起玩吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "551ea158ac30406aa1dd2c2d3a8ddbf7e66c1ae69d67c2677a6c310315083564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd0996e583ab0bc8352cd291",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着我金船大人来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d936b1d8ea62955ca5745ba78e5eddc8a0f3a5dd2f7159284079a0b7c42108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e7ebbf48d288fdd6b3c54ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青春啊ー！朝着大海奔跑吧ー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4fc32a9bf7fe3ec5719e51ddeee035992faf6d0eb43713177d412fedaf78985",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9f46a9398b53d277ba58fea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢啦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7d615aa5fb4064629ca37737b6132b598c670e96c5e5c6da2e25102d72bda6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441c753ad41a740d899b117b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然跑起来了，\r\n那就取胜吧，\r\n杜鹃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2ad51d267b3827ef9951575e20fc1933fc2a2a9cbdb149a798aa04fcdb8a05e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:613e2bffdd9af43a7e948aee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要办宴会吗！？要比赛吗！？\r\n都要整吗！？好啊，我接受挑战！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5561c057f728541a59fd1ad382297ff69c3c034484dd3e4a98b8980aef3944c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54cdac7efbe574faaa8f8adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢啦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7d615aa5fb4064629ca37737b6132b598c670e96c5e5c6da2e25102d72bda6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d290ecdfc2ef5ece17eb6b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よっしゃ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ed9af3dfb2672592f279cc3af1c0c1b8adc0a5956191ff696e326ea039743c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73ae1606e8ebc3b749a32d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还行对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c0f1a28d5a3e220b4f70e39b59a8ef1d8d540c1aca3b83b1d692eedf593739d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:402729e534bdc4248af64560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼—！就差一点对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c8bf7a5441069c86cf408ec76f912c4165c1ad73ad9de8146eb75f1b8205f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f454ef4264c86e83b805766",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既不好也不坏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e048342dd028d5874925b812cb612e12701d547bf232a7d92ef7471369bbf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:327987e9c5ed582236778924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反过来说，也挺厉害的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00818281af2a6f331238b6996ca8def3e0d6970f8bbd261055d2af4d1687b397",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e6533d9aab50c667645531",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～咿哇～咿，嘿呀！！\n嘿嘿，怎样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "137bf4e99a5a34b81fe13b07cf7f016f06da2f5e171a0dc41ac73d95d63ccc49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eda4e8d3774f8e0100a5b0a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转一圈一看哇哦！是第一的姿势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "740d246c312ce8a9b794a2d4e9a69f02d7d608e4ab9363ea795d00ecab0483b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b03b806339908f2ed9b6c43d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船的夏夏夏日时光！\r\n开始啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b277ea987f90134214e18efdecdea99125eaf225955f4b3c66f0f8101efba2b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e3e382b8ccfe8cd5a7209c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旋转一圈之后哇喔！第一名的姿势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14ede58bc70da0754f73d39d465f7c043d0d41d46548047fd08c0f3abf9289b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11c1bb087f31ff66f288dec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用法文说句我爱你……\r\n骗你的，看招～！！喝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b333b6e4ec7146417442dfcce6d018da51345c2e1ced389aef2fd3c49b71e82c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebff2ad606cf73dec3f23384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旋转一圈之后哇喔！第一名的姿势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14ede58bc70da0754f73d39d465f7c043d0d41d46548047fd08c0f3abf9289b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79772af07b2a48129df8e35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始比赛咯——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b439216ca3322b735d3365cf6ee04840ec9c562f548124dce7c5cdc7a7a874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb3af10439588cabb368773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得有趣起来了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c9b705e67ff2ea91c0d96cda2141d0d55991e49023ce924325f2f7257c97e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564ccb63cccdb8585b0a1578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "钓鱼讲究意志力，是一场与自己的\r\n战斗……钓起狡诈的泳池之王时，\r\n我的心必定会战胜氯气的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc71f1d4432310762e2d73fe3d6a420385e167395d38744c995cb2d63a289c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d79c2e512c0744e7c196f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕，外出旅行时得把养在房内的\r\n图画纸带去请别人照顾才行～！\r\n我不在身边它应该很寂寞吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "78aadf5619bb7a09dda085edd427dda691582fffdb6ec0d3608a2f99da21e5c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2224cf4981a0bfbb1836bc13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你讲，鲑鱼其实是白肉鱼喔。\r\n而这场对决也将藉由黑白分明的\r\n胜负，决定在生物学上的分类！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e0fba5311114ddd53e529af1b83420de539bc45bbc9ae16402ab4f695d587bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a855059c77e904f84917243d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得有趣起来了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c9b705e67ff2ea91c0d96cda2141d0d55991e49023ce924325f2f7257c97e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae6dc5ee695819571b4a5002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等你全部完成之后\r\n我就借给你半个世界哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08b14a1330aff9575707fa9db2bfc2af36e0c3e7f1f08f6410a38d990cc461f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b598e18c83bdf79dc217c223",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉，活动\r\n已经结束啦。\r\n等下次庆典吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5934b54003377d72d49874005fd04e2b8f7f26029a6329bd1f2e74ad24ea87f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33703eca5586572b197df7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊！吃我一招啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b0041d6a54072875b589b78cb3fcaa98a3f80e4a2448d25522ba57389dc2fd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4464539997f1917ceb37b1ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会把竹轮让给任何人的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d9173fca7c698b87e8bd8572013061b8e84830b79aef8ca25ccdd086a52987b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b331e6423bd0f1f22dbc99b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "震撼全阿船的海底世界大冒险！\r\n是礼赞还是反叛？是罪还是罚？\r\n鰤鱼还是幼鰤鱼……Coming soon！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58e2611320f472dbab404c2f03bd26f1564119a285c5332274489942f3c9dce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9021a1a3ae55440be86c95c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的法式全餐啊啊啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5cca4a6ecc88a5a0cd3c23423310602f215d3ae9cb0ed8d9c037c7d91a1c30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3425f26aa169bc53ee68cc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无数阿船沈眠于这片土地。\r\n当鱿鱼脚的香味弥漫时，花都将会\r\n遍布摊贩！传说就此展开～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e337be6fd35f059b4a47c633a74f4a52f2fbe6c0d4cf7fd8138987eeec58b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3969d1a072bb1a0490a94c52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上咯！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6307a6156580df446ec661f6a7bc561dd26e7fe9066389a88113d3afa0269729",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
